[00:13.32]Because Jehovah created
[00:17.46]The universe so grand,
[00:25.24]To him belong the earth and sky,
[00:31.96]The works of his own hand.
[00:38.34]The breath of life he has given
[00:43.46]And to his creatures shown
[00:49.59]That worthy is he to have the praise,
[00:57.93]The worship of all his own.
[01:04.70]In water Jesus was baptized
[01:19.38]To righteousness fulfill.
[01:25.07]In solemn prayer he said to God:
[01:32.74]‘I’ve come to do your will.’
[01:38.74]When he came up from the Jordan
[01:45.24]As God’s anointed Son,
[01:50.86]Obedient and loyal he would pray:
[01:58.42]‘My Father, your will be done.’
[02:17.76]We come before you, Jehovah,
[02:23.40]To praise your name so great.
[02:30.76]Disowning self, with humble hearts,
[02:37.56]Our lives we dedicate.
[02:43.60]You gave your only begotten,
[02:50.04]Who paid the price so high.
[02:56.52]No longer as living for ourselves,
[03:03.15]For you we will live or die.
